  <p>Natural gas is efficient when handled by trained plumbers. We size lines for BTU load, install shutoffs where they're required, and pressure-test systems before appliances are fired. Whether you're converting a cooktop, adding a pool heater circuit, or chasing the faint smell of mercaptan, call professionals. Never DIY gas work.</p>
  <h2>Common projects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Black iron, CSST, and approved underground runs per local amendments</li>
    <li>Gas logs, patio heaters, and outdoor kitchen manifolds</li>
    <li>Emergency shutoff tagging and homeowner education</li>
    <li>Replace old underground metal gas line with new polyethylene underground gas line</li>
    <li>Dedicated underground and above-ground gas lines for standby generators</li>
